diff --git a/examples/browser/README.md b/examples/browser/README.md
index cfca490..9fbb730 100644
--- a/examples/browser/README.md
+++ b/examples/browser/README.md
@@ -301,3 +301,12 @@ The page's visual rationale and the primary-source award/project research are in
 [PagesDesign.md](../../docs/PagesDesign.md). `icon.svg` and `social-card.svg` are
 project-owned vector originals; PNG derivatives are rasterized from these files.
 The latter uses DejaVu Sans and DejaVu Sans Mono for reproducible text rendering.
+
+## Optional Blackfin comparison
+
+The C lab can also compare **ARM / Blackfin / direct Wasm**, using bfin-gcc and
+op1emu/bcore's default copy-and-patch Wasm backend. Pages CI builds these optional assets after
+`browser_page`; for local toolchain setup, build commands and measurement
+differences, see [the C benchmark guide](../c-bench/README.md#blackfin--bcore-comparison).
+Blackfin uses a different compiler and software binary64; its ratios describe
+complete execution paths. Quick is recommended for online runs.
